This position is responsible for leading automation and system-development projects within the manufacturing environment. The role focuses on machine and system design, troubleshooting, productivity improvement, and supporting new machine installations. The person will collaborate closely with engineers and technicians, ensuring project achievement, cost saving, and compliance with relevant ISO and RBA standards.

